WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.052
Use a supported Python version and keep the project environment isolated.

00:00:05.052 --> 00:00:10.572
For this module, Python three point eleven is the recommended baseline.

00:00:10.572 --> 00:00:17.965
A virtual environment or Conda environment helps prevent one project from changing another project's package versions.

00:00:18.580 --> 00:00:27.377
The installation cell pins the versions of Transformers, Accelerate, Datasets, P E F T, and T R L used for the module.

00:00:27.377 --> 00:00:36.857
PyTorch is handled separately because the correct installation depends on the C P U, C U D A version,

00:00:36.857 --> 00:00:38.623
or platform you are using.
